<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-767] HBase interpreter does not work with HBase on a remote cluster</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-767</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;HBase interpreter fails with message &quot;ERROR: KeeperErrorCode = ConnectionLoss for /hbase&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Initially it&apos;s thought that zkquoram setttings are not getting applied, but deeper investigations reveal that hbase-site.xml cannot be loaded.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;HBASE_HOME or HBASE_CONF_DIR is set by `hbase` script when running hbase shell - interpreter will need to at minimum replicate that behavior to add the directory with hbase-site.xml to CLASS_PATH in order to fix this issue.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
