&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-767&quot; title=&quot;HBase interpreter does not work with HBase on a remote cluster&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-767&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-767&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; HBase interpreter does not work with HBase on a remote cluster&lt;/p&gt;

