		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    HBase interpreter fails with message &quot;ERROR: KeeperErrorCode = ConnectionLoss for /hbase&quot; when connecting to a remote HBASE (for instance, HBase running in CDH cluster)&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    Initially it&apos;s thought that zkquoram setttings are not getting applied, but deeper investigations reveal that hbase-site.xml cannot be loaded.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    HBASE_HOME or HBASE_CONF_DIR is set by `hbase` script when running hbase shell - interpreter will need to at minimum replicate that behavior to add the directory with hbase-site.xml to CLASS_PATH in order to fix this issue.&lt;/p&gt;

